flowchart LR
  api[FastAPI route metrics / trace-aware JSON logs] --> prom[Prometheus]
  kubelet[Real kubelet cAdvisor] --> prom
  ksm[Kube-state-metrics] --> prom
  prom --> am[Alertmanager grouping / silences]
  am --> ingest[Authenticated normalization]
  events[Namespaced Kubernetes Warning events] --> collector[Read-only Event collector]
  collector --> ingest
  ingest --> sql[PostgreSQL incidents / dedup / lifecycle]
  api --> otel[Node OTel Collector / host API logs / OTLP spans]
  otel --> loki[Loki OTLP log ingestion]
  prom --> grafana[Six provisioned Grafana dashboards]
  loki --> grafana
  sql --> app[Dashboard real incident list]
  outage[Monitoring outage] -.-> degraded[Metrics 503 / persisted incidents still readable]
